# Session start (Steward role)

**First command:** `make session-start` from repo root.

Then read `governance/SESSION_HANDOUT.md` before proposing work. State comes from disk, not chat history.

| Artifact | Role |
|---|---|
| `governance/SESSION_HANDOUT.md` | Open queue + recommended next finding |
| `governance/SESSION_END.md` | Prior session handoff |
| `governance/AUDIT_STATE.json` | Machine-generated snapshot (never hand-edit) |
| `governance/findings/F-*.yaml` | Work queue |

Methodology is only `governance/AUDIT_PROCEDURE.md` — three roles: **Steward**, **Remediator**, **Adversary**. No TIER0/1/2, no 11-dim audits, no "comprehensive review first."
